---
source: tests/it/install_planner.rs
expression: p.to_string()
---
Instalar app 19.00 (bucket main, 64bit)
  1. Instalar o lançador de comandos em C:\W\shims\.launcher\shim.exe
  2. Baixar [1] https://download.sourceforge.net/project/sevenzip/7-Zip/19.00/7z1900-x64.msi (7z1900-x64.msi, sha256 a7803233eedb6a4b59b3024ccf9292a6fffb94507dc998aa67c5b745d197a5dc)
  3. Extrair [1] 7z1900-x64.msi (MSI, sem executar o instalador) para C:\W\apps\app\.staging-19.00 (só a subpasta Files\7-Zip)
  4. Mover C:\W\apps\app\.staging-19.00 para C:\W\apps\app\19.00
  5. Apontar C:\W\apps\app\current -> C:\W\apps\app\19.00 (junção)
  6. Criar comando 7z1900-helper em C:\W\shims (7z1900-helper.exe + 7z1900-helper.shim) -> C:\W\apps\app\current\7z.exe
  7. Garantir C:\W\shims no PATH do usuário
  8. gravar C:\W\apps\app\19.00\manifest.json
  9. Registrar app 19.00 (main) em C:\W\state.db
